Xiaomi 13 Ultra / ishtar Android 17 maintenance archive

This repository contains maintenance work and source snapshots derived from
the Android Open Source Project, Evolution X, LineageOS, Linux kernel
contributors, Android Common Kernel contributors, ishtar-aosp, Xiaomi,
Qualcomm and other upstream authors identified in individual files.

The imported device, hardware, DTS, manifest and patch material is maintained
here for device continuity. Upstream projects and their original authors are
not claimed as original work of this archive.

